title: "Datoviz"
version: 0.4.0.dev0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/datoviz/datoviz"
url: "https://datoviz.org/"
abstract: >
  Datoviz is a C-first GPU rendering engine for scientific visualization. The current
  v0.4 development branch provides a retained scene API, DRP2 command streams, a native
  Vulkan/vklite runtime, generated low-level Python bindings, an array-aware direct-engine
  Python facade, and an experimental WebGPU/WASM browser subset.
keywords:
  - scientific visualization
  - GPU rendering
  - Vulkan
  - WebGPU
  - Python
  - C
